  $j${"answer": "Write it", "source": "W4's facts file aar/w3/cards_641_to_652_from_w4.md; W3 did not read the card or the press. The card was posted at 06:16 CST.", "thread": "W4", "card_id": "cmsg_017ZQamDMHrS6fqMHnQDVo584otzyTAZs2oZpEscmXAHnW", "options": {"Hold": "The engine stays as it is. A judge that corrects a pointer line at the gate still cannot cure it, and the item counts against the judge.", "Write it": "I change one line of the engine's shared library. In 42528, sol's three items would have counted as cured (uncured 9 to 6), with no change to the outcome. W1 reads it back."}, "question": "Write ASK 634 so a judge's corrected FORCED line is applied at its pair's line?", "press_time": "08:35 CST 2026-11-25", "message_above_the_card": "cmsg_017ZQamDMHrS6fqMHnQDVo582HTcBQvHEbeAAvhuJJA9sb"}$j$::jsonb,
